    ✔ retains POST503 intent through real identity cleanup and GET401/403, then reads the same task key
    ✔ rechecks the shared scope intent before another retained pane can post
    ✔ does not let a late reconciliation of an acknowledged task erase another pane's newer unknown intent
    ✔ allows explicit correction after original POST422 but not after a refused formal detail read

  JYT-UX-W05 field-level DRAFT-v1 limits
    ✔ rejects 201-character titles locally before create or CAS replacement and keeps the saved draft
    ✔ loads and saves legitimate 16001–20000-character instructions with exact CAS and Unicode code-point title limits
    ✔ serializes unselected agent and MIME as null, not invalid optional exact empty strings

  HallOnboarding mounted geometry
    ✔ scrolls a partially clipped portrait target once, then renders a finite card fully inside the viewport (106ms)
    ✔ keeps a missing target card centered with navigation and explanatory fallback content (56ms)
    ✔ restarts at the matching first step after a portrait-to-landscape class switch (54ms)
    ✔ focuses a shipped hotspot before measuring it and keeps virtual-landscape text aligned with the rotated hall (70ms)

