    ✔ routes review evidence to the exact canonical formal task and delivery without an acceptance or private mark call (53ms)

  JYT-UX-W05 independent Hall read model
    ✔ uses a query-free overview and retains unknown counts and exact source refs
    ✔ retains partial/failed sources without hiding the other source or pretending empty
    ✔ continues only the requested source with its opaque cursor (not the ID length limit)
    ✔ retries a failed page with the same cursor while showing retained data as unconfirmed
    ✔ clears all summaries after 401 without issuing any mutation
    ✔ clears all summaries after 403 without issuing any mutation
    ✔ fences late account A results and never displays them for account B
    ✔ does not fetch without a stable scope and clears data on lifecycle identity cleanup
    ✔ rejects cross-partition source types and mismatched evidence without losing valid partitions
    ✔ loads a canonical formal task by ref instead of using an overview summary as a task
    ✔ reports a read error, not a successful empty overview, on 503 or invalid envelope
    ✔ preserves compatible private mark and formal review evidence without conflating action types
    ✔ loads archive by independent applicable source and retains an explicit draft archive error instead of empty success

  JYT-UX-W05 MARK-v1 private organization
